    "media:imagetext": "MOVING TO\nCONCORD\nSHHH...\n• ••\nWe're moving.\nBeginning Saturday, July 20th\nWe will serve Contra Costa County\nThrough Buchanan Field in Concord\nQuietly Speaking.....\nWe think you'll enjoy\n• Ample free parking\n(no hill to climb with baggage\nin hand)\n• Coffee shop \u0026 restaurant\n• Car - rentals\n• Excellent freeway access\nHere's our Schedule...\nCONCORDI\nFROM\nCONTRA COSTA\n(CONCORD)\nARRIVE\nS. F. AIRPORT\nPier\nGate 56\n6:51\nPate 45\n:55\nTKEQUENCT\nEx Sa Su\nDaily\nEx Sa\nSa Su\nOnly\nDaily\n-x›a\nEx Sa Su\n602\n612\nTO\nCONTRA COSTA\n(CONCORD)\nLEAVE\nS. F. AIRPORT\nPier\nSate 45\nGate 56\n6:40\n6:36\nCONCORDI\n7:01\nFREQUENCY\nEx Sa Su\nex sasu\nSa Only\nNIGHT\nEx Sa Su\nTo\nimprove our image....\nWe're trying to be as quiet as\nlittle mice, so could you gently\ntell your friends to call\n939-2222 for reservations and\ninformation.",
